# Claude Code: share project skills with the team, keep local agent state
# (worktrees, scheduled-task locks, settings.local, scout CLEANUP.md) out.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
# test/ doubles as a scratch area for device bring-up (vendor firmware dumps, sample
# EPUBs, logs). Ignore it by default, but keep the tracked unit-test paths visible so a
# newly added test is not silently invisible to git.
test/*
!test/CMakeLists.txt
!test/README
!test/differential_rounding/
!test/epubs/
# Generated by pioarduino when an env sets custom_sdkconfig (the hz52 64-byte cache line
# rebuild). Derived from the Arduino framework's own sdkconfig template at build time.
/sdkconfig.defaults
/sdkconfig.*
# Also generated by the custom_sdkconfig rebuild: the IDF component manager's download
# cache and the placeholder component espidf.py creates to satisfy CMake.
/managed_components/
/.dummy/
/dependencies.lock
